    {
      "type": "grammar",
      "id": "u18.d01.grammar",
      "title": {
        "en": "Reported statements & backshift",
        "ru": "Косвенные утверждения и сдвиг времени"
      },
      "rule": {
        "en": "When we report what someone said, the verb usually moves one step back into the past (present → past, will → would, can → could). Pronouns and time words may also change.",
        "ru": "Когда пересказываем чужие слова, глагол обычно сдвигается на шаг в прошлое (present → past, will → would, can → could). Местоимения и слова времени тоже могут меняться."
      },
      "patterns": [
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "present → past",
            "ru": "present → past"
          },
          "formula": "\"I am tired\" → said (that) he was tired",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "\"I am busy.\" → He said he was busy.",
              "ru": "«Я занят.» → Он сказал, что занят."
            }
          ],
          "ref": "reported-speech"
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "will → would",
            "ru": "will → would"
          },
          "formula": "\"I will come\" → said he would come",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "\"I will help.\" → She said she would help.",
              "ru": "«Я помогу.» → Она сказала, что поможет."
            }
          ],
          "ref": "reported-speech"
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "say / tell",
            "ru": "say / tell"
          },
          "formula": "say (that) · tell + person (that)",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "She told me she was late.",
              "ru": "Она сказала мне, что опаздывает."
            }
          ],
          "ref": "reported-speech"
        }
      ],
      "pitfalls": [
        {
          "en": "\"tell\" needs a person, \"say\" does not: \"She told me…\", \"She said…\" — not \"She said me…\".",
          "ru": "«tell» требует человека, «say» — нет: «She told me…», «She said…» — не «She said me…»."
        },
        {
          "en": "Shift the tense back: \"I am tired\" → \"She said she was tired\".",
          "ru": "Сдвигай время назад: «I am tired» → «She said she was tired»."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "reading",
      "id": "u18.d01.reading",
      "title": {
        "en": "A message from the boss",
        "ru": "Сообщение от начальника"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "u18.d01.reading.b1",
          "en": "This morning my boss sent a message to the whole team. She said that the deadline had changed and that we would have one more week. She also said she was very happy with our work.",
          "ru": "Сегодня утром начальница отправила сообщение всей команде. Она сказала, что срок сдвинулся и что у нас будет ещё одна неделя. Ещё она сказала, что очень довольна нашей работой.",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u18.d01.reading.b1.wav",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "u18.d01.reading.b2",
          "en": "Later, Tom told me that he was worried about the new plan. He said he didn't understand one part of it. I explained it to him, and he replied that everything was clear now.",
          "ru": "Позже Том сказал мне, что переживает из-за нового плана. Он сказал, что не понимает одну его часть. Я объяснил ему, и он ответил, что теперь всё ясно.",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u18.d01.reading.b2.wav",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
